      "content": "# Don and Debbie: dreamers",
      "type": "title"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 636,
      "topLeftY": 65,
      "bottomRightX": 657,
      "bottomRightY": 81,
      "content": "2.4",
      "type": "header"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 190,
      "topLeftY": 103,
      "bottomRightX": 570,
      "bottomRightY": 121,
      "content": "Listen to the conversation. What does Jim think of Don's dream?",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 190,
      "topLeftY": 122,
      "bottomRightX": 420,
      "bottomRightY": 138,
      "content": "Do activities A and B in the Workbook.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 190,
      "topLeftY": 140,
      "bottomRightX": 398,
      "bottomRightY": 156,
      "content": "Listen and repeat the conversation.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 90,
      "topLeftY": 179,
      "bottomRightX": 152,
      "bottomRightY": 193,
      "content": "Show interest",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 193,
      "topLeftY": 169,
      "bottomRightX": 516,
      "bottomRightY": 187,
      "content": "Don: I had a dream last night. Well, a nightmare, actually.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 194,
      "topLeftY": 187,
      "bottomRightX": 344,
      "bottomRightY": 202,
      "content": "Jim: Really! What about?",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 92,
      "topLeftY": 217,
      "bottomRightX": 177,
      "bottomRightY": 231,
      "content": "Ask for clarification",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 193,
      "topLeftY": 203,
      "bottomRightX": 613,
      "bottomRightY": 219,
      "content": "Don: It was awful. I was terrified. There were men with horrible faces and...",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 194,
      "topLeftY": 220,
      "bottomRightX": 549,
      "bottomRightY": 252,
      "content": "Jim: Just a minute. Calm down. Begin at the beginning. Now ... Where were you?",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 92,
      "topLeftY": 254,
      "bottomRightX": 148,
      "bottomRightY": 268,
      "content": "Set the scene",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 193,
      "topLeftY": 253,
      "bottomRightX": 502,
      "bottomRightY": 270,
      "content": "Don: I dreamt that we were working in the fields and ...",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 194,
      "topLeftY": 270,
      "bottomRightX": 405,
      "bottomRightY": 286,
      "content": "Jim: Who was? Who were you with?",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 193,
      "topLeftY": 287,
      "bottomRightX": 620,
      "bottomRightY": 320,
      "content": "Don: My brother. My elder brother. We were planting seed for next year. And I was driving the tractor. And it was brilliant weather. Then suddenly ...",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 194,
      "topLeftY": 320,
      "bottomRightX": 459,
      "bottomRightY": 337,
      "content": "Jim: Slow down. Slow down. What happened?",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 92,
      "topLeftY": 341,
      "bottomRightX": 148,
      "bottomRightY": 354,
      "content": "Tell the story",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 193,
      "topLeftY": 337,
      "bottomRightX": 606,
      "bottomRightY": 354,
      "content": "Don: I heard somebody shouting. Then I saw two men running towards us.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 92,
      "topLeftY": 355,
      "bottomRightX": 177,
      "bottomRightY": 367,
      "content": "Ask for clarification",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 194,
      "topLeftY": 354,
      "bottomRightX": 321,
      "bottomRightY": 370,
      "content": "Jim: Who were they?",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 193,
      "topLeftY": 371,
      "bottomRightX": 604,
      "bottomRightY": 403,
      "content": "Don: I don't know. But they were really scary. One was holding a gun. My brother and I wanted to run but we couldn't move. It was terrible.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 194,
      "topLeftY": 403,
      "bottomRightX": 363,
      "bottomRightY": 420,
      "content": "Jim: So how did you escape?",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 193,
      "topLeftY": 420,
      "bottomRightX": 289,
      "bottomRightY": 437,
      "content": "Don: I woke up.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 85,
      "topLeftY": 454,
      "bottomRightX": 585,
      "bottomRightY": 471,
      "content": "Listen to the conversation. What does Jennie think of Debbie's dream?",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 87,
      "topLeftY": 473,
      "bottomRightX": 359,
      "bottomRightY": 490,
      "content": "Do activities C and D in the Workbook.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 87,
      "topLeftY": 492,
      "bottomRightX": 337,
      "bottomRightY": 509,
      "content": "Listen and repeat the conversation.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 106,
      "topLeftY": 532,
      "bottomRightX": 578,
      "bottomRightY": 551,
      "content": "Debbie: I had a brilliant dream last night. It was wonderful. I didn't want to wake up.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 109,
      "topLeftY": 551,
      "bottomRightX": 438,
      "bottomRightY": 567,
      "content": "Jennie: Oh, no. Not again. Well, what was this one about?",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 108,
      "topLeftY": 567,
      "bottomRightX": 613,
      "bottomRightY": 584,
      "content": "Debbie: I dreamt that I was flying in a balloon. The moon was shining and the stars were ...",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 109,
      "topLeftY": 584,
      "bottomRightX": 447,
      "bottomRightY": 600,
      "content": "Jennie: Just a minute. You were flying in a balloon at night!",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 108,
      "topLeftY": 600,
      "bottomRightX": 591,
      "bottomRightY": 617,
      "content": "Debbie: Yes. It was beautiful. I was flying high above the clouds. And then suddenly ...",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 109,
      "topLeftY": 617,
      "bottomRightX": 281,
      "bottomRightY": 634,
      "content": "Jennie: You saw a spaceship.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 108,
      "topLeftY": 634,
      "bottomRightX": 339,
      "bottomRightY": 650,
      "content": "Debbie: No. I heard a bird talking to me.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 109,
      "topLeftY": 650,
      "bottomRightX": 339,
      "bottomRightY": 667,
      "content": "Jennie: You heard a bird talking to you!",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 108,
      "topLeftY": 667,
      "bottomRightX": 510,
      "bottomRightY": 684,
      "content": "Debbie: Yes. It told me to get out of the balloon and climb onto its back.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 109,
      "topLeftY": 684,
      "bottomRightX": 314,
      "bottomRightY": 700,
      "content": "Jennie: And you got out, of course.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 108,
      "topLeftY": 700,
      "bottomRightX": 604,
      "bottomRightY": 733,
      "content": "Debbie: Of course. We flew over the mountains and over the sea. I could see lots of small boats about a kilometre below me. It was wonderful. But then it ended.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 109,
      "topLeftY": 734,
      "bottomRightX": 292,
      "bottomRightY": 750,
      "content": "Jennie: Why? What happened?",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 108,
      "topLeftY": 750,
      "bottomRightX": 425,
      "bottomRightY": 767,
      "content": "Debbie: I lost my hold on the bird's feathers and fell off.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 109,
      "topLeftY": 768,
      "bottomRightX": 433,
      "bottomRightY": 784,
      "content": "Jennie: And how did you survive this one-kilometre fall?",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 108,
      "topLeftY": 784,
      "bottomRightX": 222,
      "bottomRightY": 800,
      "content": "Debbie: I woke up.",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 177,
      "topLeftY": 826,
      "bottomRightX": 533,
      "bottomRightY": 863,
      "content": "Ask questions about one of your partner's dreams and answer questions about one of your own.",
      "type": "text"
    },
